  <item>
    <title>Vol.44 对话时尚博主奥米：带着球拍去旅行？Why not！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69da4f0be2c8be3155f233aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69da4f0be2c8be3155f233aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Apr 2026 13:52:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春日北京的一个下午，我们与嘉宾奥米塔夫在</span><strong><span>大小电波播客空间</span></strong><span>相聚。他从职场人到时尚网球博主的转变，探讨网球如何成为连接生活、时尚与旅行的桥梁。我们从各自的网球启蒙，聊到了穿搭、旅行和观赛，体验网球带给我们更多元的价值。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在进入正题之前，想先分享一个细节：在后期剪辑时，一度感慨，这期的金句真的多到爆，可能也正是因为对网球那份发自内心的爱，才能在对话中完成如此多的输出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/2JjES0D8MK4" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/2JjES0D8MK4"><span>奥米塔夫Aumitav</span></a><span>——网球时尚博主、前华为海外公关，带着球拍打卡四大满贯（微博&amp;小红书@奥米塔夫Aumitav）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqejhv_biLcx7V3TlHEClAmord56.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Andy、Theo</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a>为什么选择"时尚网球"赛道？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 网球启蒙：与莎娃在新闻中心对视的那一瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 旅行观的转变：从打卡到带着球拍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">36:16</a> 看四大满贯曾遭遇过的波折</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">39:15</a> 带着球拍去旅行是网球爱好者的生活仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 旅行时推荐带的网球装备及托运攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3231">53:51</a> 四大满贯观看排序：法网≈澳网 &gt; 温网 &gt; 美网</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3308">55:08</a> 扎帐篷2天才能排到温网中心场的门票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">67:30</a>网球时尚博主是怎么出片的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【互动话题】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>你有带过球拍出去旅行过吗？有没有遇到什么"名场面"？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你最想去哪个大满贯现场打卡？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>超快感——孙燕姿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期录制地点】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大小电波播客空间（麦子店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64721e10948d99227f6af8f2/luVcEdmUnnd5m77Erk_hOGPj0uRa.m4a" length="67641948" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrUDbzM_pLgZQFzGymrwFOb8fsQL.png"/>
