  <item>
    <title>Vol.42 串台| 2025网球季，可以期待点儿啥？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677a912615a5fd520e356016</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677a912615a5fd520e356016</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 14:07:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有网球陪伴的日子都是好日子。新年甚至还没到，2025赛季就已经拉开了帷幕，在经历了一个令人难忘的2024赛季后，想必大家都对新赛季都期待值拉满。关于2025网球季，我们可以期待点啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，Theo做客我们的好朋友Frank新开的播客「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/676bc9c815a5fd520e7996a5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/676bc9c815a5fd520e7996a5"><span>网开了聊」</span></a><span>（欢迎大家多多订阅）展望2025网球赛季，并在线敲完Andy早点结束繁忙的工作归队录音。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhR4oKqAccJ7TMkhVCIVIk5e6rhX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：Theo、Frank</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-Shownotes-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 2024赛季回顾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 2024赛季的难忘记忆：郑钦文和德约科维奇的巴黎奥运会金牌时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 如何评价李娜和穆古拉扎双双出任赛事总监</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 2025赛季前瞻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 郑钦文将在2025赛季交出一份怎样的答卷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 在巡回赛站稳脚跟的中国男子军团还会带来哪些惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 女子网坛世界前五球员萨巴伦卡、斯瓦泰克、高芙等的2025赛季展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 牵手穆雷的德约科维奇能在2025赛季赢得第25座大满贯冠军吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a> 阿尔卡拉斯和辛纳领衔的男子网坛新格局分析</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3 赛季预测</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">43:06</a> 四大满贯（澳网、法网、温网、美网）男女单冠军归属？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2813">46:53</a> 最大黑马（剧透：主播弃权了...）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Everglow - Coldplay、Biblical - Calum Scott</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
