  <item>
    <title>Vol.41 纳达尔退役| 传奇挥别时需要用力告别吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6762d12bea209de6884ace50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6762d12bea209de6884ace50</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 13:59:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>岁末年初，气氛已进入到了各种总结阶段。谷歌的年度盘点视频中，最后一个镜头留给了传奇网球巨星纳达尔的退役告别时刻。而在每年的职业体育赛场，总有一些球员会选择与他们曾经奋力征战的赛场深情告别。今天和网球媒体人</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1146439687" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1146439687"><span>@张曼联</span></a><span>，从纳达尔退役为角度，聊聊那些2024告别赛场的ta们、聊聊网球以外的生活。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYEjlQXUuQhR3PVbRU_UnHeuPr6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：Andy、Theo</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1146439687" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1146439687"><strong><span>@张曼联</span></strong></a><strong><span>（网球媒体人）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-ShowNotes-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 梦幻的西班牙之旅并不源于“纳达尔宣布退役”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> 整个城市都是纳达尔的气息</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 曼叔给自己布置的课题完成了吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 纳达尔的退役仪式略显仓促</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 2025肯定有多个赛事为纳达尔准备特别仪式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 曼叔回忆与纳达尔的上次见面</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> 娜姐的退役仪式：永远难忘“夜空中最亮的星”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 在成为纳达尔球迷前，曼叔其实是红土球迷？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> 在今年告别网坛的Ta们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 穆雷：我退役了但好像又还在</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3169">52:49</a> 德尔波特罗的退役仪式：网坛很有爱的一幕</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3596">59:56</a> 球员退役仪式到底应该怎么办才算满意？</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkjLO4CFxUlOKhArBkpI7g_KlXVX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵本期音乐：游乐园——戴佩妮</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🔍收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
