  <item>
    <title>Vol.40 看网球是追星还是追球？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67133353db2cf82757519637</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67133353db2cf82757519637</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Oct 2024 04:19:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着郑钦文正式确认获得今年年终总决赛的参赛资格，梦幻的2024中国赛季为已越来越旺盛的中国网球热潮又添了一把猛火。不断涌入的“新网球迷”带着好奇又有些惶恐，他们想快速融入新圈子，又害怕破坏原有的宁静。他们因谁而来，又为何而留？没关系，这个问题不用这么急着想出答案。因为爱网球这件事，从什么时候开始都不算晚。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️主播：Andy、Theo</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：@</span></strong><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2811943847" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2811943847"><strong><span>Frank</span></strong></a><strong><span>（前媒体人、网球资深爱好者）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrroQnhf4xiw25R5K7l3CyxXTc1I.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">6:53</a> 对中国赛季印象最深的人和事是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 看网球是追星还是追球？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> Frank的上海大师赛之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">31:53</a> 世界网球同时也在接受中国文化的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 中网球员酒会的台前幕后</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fph9hNAN_ShD-0KpKmi_OPOM_rsU.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期音乐：经济舱—刘聪</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🧣微博：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
