  <item>
    <title>Vol.39 网球中国赛季怎么看？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f28d0969b6a485e88fbdf9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f28d0969b6a485e88fbdf9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Sep 2024 09:57:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>郑钦文奥运夺冠后，网球的关注度和热度呈指数暴涨。一年一度的职业网球巡回赛来到中国时间，该怎么看？和过往有哪些新的变化和提升，邀请前媒体人、网球资深爱好者Frank继续和我们聊聊网球。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢（这期在中秋节后录制，对于成都和杭州这2站比赛来说可能会有稍许滞后。纯属个人观点，欢迎大家友好讨论）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️主播：Andy、Theo</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be3b7d44125cb000154df09?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5be3b7d44125cb000154df09&amp;apptime=1720373665&amp;share_id=c0772cab8a9e4d8988cc65a331cc3086" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be3b7d44125cb000154df09?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5be3b7d44125cb000154df09&amp;apptime=1720373665&amp;share_id=c0772cab8a9e4d8988cc65a331cc3086"><strong><span>@Frank</span></strong></a><strong><span>（前媒体人、网球资深爱好者）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> 中国网球赛季整体安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 在成都&amp;杭州：小而精的温情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a> 在北京：网动青春，属于中网的国际范儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 在上海：大师赛的专属Vibe</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3482">58:02</a> 在武汉：湖北与网球的不解之缘</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期音乐：where did u go—邓紫棋</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🧣微博：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><strong><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><strong><span>@Theo-Lau</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
