  <item>
    <title>Vol.38 巴黎奥运落幕，聊聊中国女排的未来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d312124a0f950f848756a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d312124a0f950f848756a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Aug 2024 12:52:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>中国女排的奥运征途已过去一个月左右了。失落遗憾也好、回味也罢，最后都得向前看，未来永远会是更闪耀的对吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>巴黎周期已经打板收官，新赛季和新周期都即将打响，国内外的联赛无论是阵容还是改革都让人对接下来几个月或是未来几年都有更大的憧憬。Show must go on🎆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqMifDy_NGYFynnmT7tfJVGBbtAr.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播：</span><strong><span>Theo</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>Andy</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📩</span><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">6:15</a> 时隔一个月再谈女排八进四</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 把每次触球都当成最后一次，这是女排的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 遗憾&gt;难过OR难过&gt;遗憾？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 新赛季排超的改革大刀阔斧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> 新生代球员展现天赋后需要伯乐和引路人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> Andy希望新的周期能更大胆地去试错</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgHIo_Qt1kVwyQDybQGkmfFz_258.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵本期音乐：生命之河——王菲/那英</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🧣微博：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
