  <item>
    <title>Vol.37 郑钦文的奥运金牌对于网球有什么意义？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b5d3c433591c27bee1e9c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b5d3c433591c27bee1e9c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 08:31:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>巴黎奥运会，对于网球迷来说无疑是幸福的。在罗兰加洛斯，这个中国网球的福地，我们创历史的取得了1金（郑钦文女单🏅）和1银（王欣瑜/张之臻混双🥈）的好成绩。今天，我们就来聊聊网球在巴黎奥运的故事。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FraC4VtyuGzi4aHGHB7ygQUR0j3m.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQNVrt7HxBHiPJYvgSw8GaRss3W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期音乐：天空没有极限</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👀联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🧣微博：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 </span><strong><span>小宇宙 App</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在</span><strong><span>苹果Podcast</span></strong><span>及</span><strong><span>网易云音乐</span></strong><span>搜索</span><strong><span>【一传上网】</span></strong><span>找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
