    <title>Vol.36 与奥运现场MC聊聊赛场气氛担当背后的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669e6b328fcadceb90242c90</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669e6b328fcadceb90242c90</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jul 2024 14:22:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从东京奥运的《阳光总在风雨后》到今年VNL香港的《红日》，总有一个时刻你能与中国女排共情，或伤心或激动，但这背后也少不了一群小伙伴的努力和用心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>巴黎奥运开始前，我们邀请了东京奥运会排球项目的现场MC李和林老师作客，与我们共同聊聊体育场上气氛组现场和背后的那些事儿~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：Andy、Theo</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1651320360" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1651320360"><strong><span>@李和林</span></strong></a><strong><span>（体育展示导演、MC)曾服务过北京奥运会、东京奥运会、北京冬奥会等，国际排联各项赛事等</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq0DDoHAbmZmzx3TYw6okSTQIKBo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 排球场上的气氛组都是怎么搞花活儿的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> 体育展示精确的各环节精确到秒，会紧张吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 体育展示更多是锦上添花嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 什么契机走上了体育展示的道路？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 精彩的体育展示都要准备什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 赛场上的选歌和球员发生的化学反应！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 全场1万人喊中国女排的名字是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 体育展示是一份有激情又有温度的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> 东京奥运最后一场致敬郎导的那首《阳光总在风雨后》背后的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> 服务奥运和其他大赛区别到底在哪儿？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvdaFNMfq8g8SLJ5k7qFxPsUolFz.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>本期图片均由李和林老师提供</span></em></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期音乐：Les Champs-Elysées</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👀联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🧣微博：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 </span><strong><span>小宇宙 App</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在</span><strong><span>苹果Podcast</span></strong><span>及</span><strong><span>网易云音乐</span></strong><span>搜索</span><strong><span>【一传上网】</span></strong><span>找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
