    <title>Vol.34 何以温网？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668b53e2ae8e21859a3cbc87</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668b53e2ae8e21859a3cbc87</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 02:50:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于温网的记忆，似乎总是与其他3个大满贯有所不同。蓝天、白云、草地和奶油草莓构成温网的各种符号。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那温网何以为温网？我们心中的温网又是什么样的呢，这期我们也邀请前媒体人、网球资深爱好者Frank与我们共同聊聊~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhkmPCo24hXvUGsBGRe3d0SdIU4M.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>📢（纯属个人观点，欢迎大家友好讨论）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>主播：Andy、Theo</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be3b7d44125cb000154df09?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5be3b7d44125cb000154df09&amp;apptime=1720373665&amp;share_id=c0772cab8a9e4d8988cc65a331cc3086" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be3b7d44125cb000154df09?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5be3b7d44125cb000154df09&amp;apptime=1720373665&amp;share_id=c0772cab8a9e4d8988cc65a331cc3086"><strong><span>@Frank</span></strong></a><strong><span>（前媒体人、网球资深爱好者）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📩</span><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a>为什么说温网是网球的”童话世界”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 跟着赛事去旅行，感受伦敦的英伦风情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 关于温网的那些记忆：莎娃夺冠20周年、温网百年纪念</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjMaIeKNokgHlYXQu6PRTMaEYYPu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 穆雷退役，网球只是人生高光中的一部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2942">49:02</a> 保留曲目：温网冠亚军竞猜时刻</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHRXodVkHPW81eQN0gQu6miCrLT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期音乐：温网为穆雷制作的纪念短片背景音</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🧣</span><strong><span>微博：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><strong><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><strong><span>@Theo-Lau</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
