  <item>
    <title>Vol.33 虽迟但到，聊聊中国女排的巴黎之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6673ad82c26e396a3613c99b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6673ad82c26e396a3613c99b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 04:18:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着巴黎奥运会女排小组抽签的尘埃落定，中国女排可以说是已经正式进入最后的冲刺阶段。而在这之前的VNL中国香港站上，略微出乎意料的四连胜收官，中国女排收获了无比宝贵的逆风翻盘经验。无论是上签、中签还是下签，做好自己才是最大的好签。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FufQodrePiJPH_eils_P76d48kmC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️主播：</span></strong><span>Theo、Andy</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📩Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">2:28</a> 巴黎奥运会女排分组出炉，</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">6:55</a> 复杂的奥运赛程到底怎么决出前八？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 四队一组可能出现连环套的局面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> 现场追女排感受完全不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 分站赛的最后两场比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> Theo和Andy最想聊聊哪位球员？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 曼谷总决赛的悬念在于阵容？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl6BhBeI7Dhbs7cgsokk5UyJTYA0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期音乐：</span></strong><span>《红日》</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🧣微博：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
