  <item>
    <title>Vol.32 从巴黎到北京，遇见热爱多一拍！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66632c7594977a26eff2b495</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66632c7594977a26eff2b495</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Jun 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>法国巴黎，罗兰·加洛斯的红土场热情似火，属于网球的年度盛宴即将迎来最高潮。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国北京，国家网球中心的红土花园球场同样精彩，感受原汁原味的法式运动生活方式，领略独特的松弛感。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj1dH8exif5o1DmdzEOeOHbIjPv0.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢le coq sportif乐卡克对于本期节目的的支持。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🎾互动：评论区留下你对</span><strong><span>“热爱多一拍”</span></strong><span>的理解，我们将在听众中选取1位送出由乐卡克提供的精美礼品一份。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loQymT1CgtAf42wx9omK48Ok_XDp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️主播：Theo、Andy</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📩Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part1 2024法网有什么不一样？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 纳达尔与德约的伤退给法网带来了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> &nbsp;中国网球军团整体表现稳定</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part2 在巴黎的法网，当时尚之都与网球相遇，会发生什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a>巴黎是一座有很多标签的城市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a>服饰与职业网球运动员的符号关联</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a>“法国制造”的专属浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part3 在北京的中网，感受原汁味的法网美学体验</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a> 藏在国家网球中心的宝藏红土球场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 打红土，看法网，属于One More Shot的力量</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part4 “热爱多一拍”其实是一种生活哲学？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 找到人生的快乐是让生活多一份温暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1792">29:52</a> 不止于球场，生活就是“热爱多一拍”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhc8wtypGVpgdflRJxrcYos7YdqO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期音乐：Home To You</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🧣微博：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7754122858"><span>@刘颖健Andyball</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1751247730"><span>@Theo-Lau</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们当然推荐使用 小宇宙 App</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果Podcast、网易云音乐、新浪微博搜索【一传上网】找到我们</span></p>]]></description>
